Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.81,0:00:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)快斗！和你的了断
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，这是事实上的决赛了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)好吧，我接受。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我至今为止 都是为了隼人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为 No.猎人在战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(隼人)哥哥 你要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放心吧 我绝对不会输的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光 总觉得身体开始麻麻酥酥的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗那家伙 超强的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.51,0:01:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一次遇到那家伙的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们被打得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}落花流水。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你一起变成ZEXAL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在皇之键里战斗过。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了救小春
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还进行过组队决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此我才觉得快斗是个超强的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 越是这么觉得{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他就越成了我必须跨越的目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要和你一起一定要打败那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)游马那家伙干劲十足啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.57,0:02:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知怎么的我也紧张起来了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君能赢过快斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道啊但这就是事实上的决赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫)没问题的。如果是游马的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会赢的喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵的声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:02:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你们久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(观众)让我们见识一下吧你们的斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(观众席7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那种蠢货游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狠狠打趴下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多洛华)快斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 今天一定要做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以决斗者的尊严为赌注 向你发起挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会拼上全力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来迎战你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视野 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 游……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输了我可不会轻易放过你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光也是 别板着脸好好加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 等等 你 难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看得见这家伙吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得变得能看见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来因为之前那场战斗的影响{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能看见我身姿的人好像出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 鲨鱼和快斗也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 星光体 游马不攻过来吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道 上吧先攻 我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 顽抗骑士以攻击表示召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙！ 就算顽抗骑士{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:06:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一般来说 攻击力零的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击表示召唤出来什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 加油啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法 零之锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.11,0:07:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在于场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是快斗的话 在开局
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出银河眼也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}十分有可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和枪手骑士的效果配合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用双重策略迎击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马确实 你这家伙变强了》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…… 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我场上没有怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 光子斩击者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我将通常召唤光子粉碎者。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2000以上的怪兽有２只。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明知道这个防守方式还打算刻意召唤吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 攻击力2000的光子粉碎者与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2100的光子斩击者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光寄宿于我仆人之身。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作银河的尘埃消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼攻击枪兵龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于零零锁的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对攻击力为零的我的枪兵龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 银河爆发。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡直到我的回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将银河眼的攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手场上的表侧表示的卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多可以无效两张。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}枪兵龙的怪兽效果和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}零零锁的效果封印。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的防御！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是考虑到了我们招数的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步，才召唤出银河眼的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼攻击枪兵龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然就造成了1500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是赢不了快斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没那回事呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)对啊 游马 站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗才刚刚开始呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《一直都是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你无论多少次都会重新站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}面向前方…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法 战斗重力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 控制怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家如果没有进行战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要受到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000点的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要受到1000点的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊 那算啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}意思是面对银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须得打一场是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河暴的效果结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的攻击力和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的零之锁效果恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你怎么费尽心机对我都是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得对 海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 跟你的决斗就得是这样才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样来 那样去 就变成这样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！ 真有意思对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的战术哪里有意思了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战术什么的我才不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说的是心里的那种激动啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心里的怦怦跳？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 这份怦怦跳就是决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 只要进行决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能超了解对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能成为同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像这样怦怦跳传递出去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都聚集过来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那啥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:11:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怦怦跳连结。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这气势真比不过。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也在怦怦跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为游马和快斗的决斗而跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心里的怦怦跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有这份怦怦跳大家都能成为同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗 就能合为一体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你也一样吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把你全力的给我看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真正的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有打倒你们的 No.卡才算数。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 呼唤吧 把 No.卡唤出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 就让你见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识我的斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 哥布林德伯格！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥布林德伯格召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把1只等级4以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！ 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的哥布林德伯格和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普攻击银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！ 霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力明明更低 为什么喵？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普的攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不知道你在打什么主意你忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为战斗重力的效果 不进行战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要受到1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 闪光效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中当怪兽效果发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽1体的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升800点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的所有怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼的效果就！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法把怪兽除外了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力提升到3300！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 银河眼和希望皇霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果将被无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会把怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的效果也不会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让战斗无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:15:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 在提升攻击力之后继续战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果也我可不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动，战斗模拟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的怪兽在战斗期间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半且不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把战斗伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}压到最低限度了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这气势不赖。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.59,0:15:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法，拜拜绑定！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，以我场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只攻击力下降的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为对象发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间，那只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且战斗模拟的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以破坏对方怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到银河眼竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普！大霍普剑·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有陷阱和魔法的效果结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力和效果恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给快斗造成大伤害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样啊怎么样啊，阿斯特拉尔喂，很厉害吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是不是超厉害？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙不管失败多少次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管被逼到怎样的绝境{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都从不放弃拼命地重新站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，是打从心底享受决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，现在的我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，难道说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥，果然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经无法决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我投降。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊什么叫无法决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，哥哥……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经……{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的意义我找不到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我至今为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直都只是为了隼人才进行决斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但隼人得救的现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我战斗的意义 全都消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我已经……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了你可是我的目标啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}擅自说不干了我绝对不会允许！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我已经无法像你那样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再热血地进行决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马 那不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马为了收集 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与我一同战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利为我带来了失去的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那不过是过去的集合罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与游马的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我带来了更加重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗 以心交心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不断加深羁绊的伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特 你也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说你是重要的伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记忆是属于过去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伙伴是在未来之中的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也 已经不必再被过去所束缚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早就察觉到了不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以你才来到了这个地方不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((果然 决斗者大家都是伙伴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我遇见全新的自己 让我热血沸腾。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和隼人约好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会让你见到他))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是快斗啊 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直感受得到你那颗怦怦直跳的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你的心跳可不止这种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更多 还要更多让我看看吧 给我看！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我感受吧那心跳加速！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.菲卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 全都是我的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们大人的算计一直在折磨着快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到现在也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系的 爸爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥的眼睛正想要回应游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心跳加速可不会腻。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前方等待着什么我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.89,0:21:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就让我来开辟吧我自己的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我自己的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德鲁瓦)看来 快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经取回了自己的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马真是个不可思议的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马的儿子吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 回去吧 回到我们的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托马斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米海尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 父亲大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})游马总有一天 一定会再见的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
